  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
      <span style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#3b82f6; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;">Partner MFB Loan App</span>
      <span style="font-size:11px; background:#1e293b; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; color:#94a3b8;">Embed Demo</span>
    </div>
    
    <h1 style="margin-top:16px;">Apply for ₦500,000 SME Growth Loan</h1>
    <p>
      To complete your loan appraisal in under 60 seconds, connect your primary commercial or neobank statement below.
    </p>

